            <div class="mm-kv-row"><span class="mm-kv-label">Mandatory KYC &amp; Joining Docs</span><span class="mm-kv-val">Aadhaar Card, PAN Card, Bank Passbook, 2 Photos, Educational Certificates</span></div>
